  "_comment": "Hand-checked ground truth for scripts/verify-token-report.sh section 7. Shaped exactly like docs/token-baseline.json so the SAME --check/--audit code paths run against a hermetic fixture. The tree seeds EIGHT entities across THREE wf_*.json sidecars: SEVEN attributable review units plus ONE orphan agent that is deliberately NOT a unit. wf_rank001 (clean): A determining at rank 1; B determining at rank 4, with its findings emitted OUT of ranked order so the imported rankFindings is load-bearing; C non-determining (its candidates are refuted, below the confidence floor, or non-gating suggestions); F a plan-mode multi-line target whose finder and refuter must resolve to a byte-identical unitIdent, seeded as a second non-determining unit. wf_rank002 (mixed): G determining at rank 2, sharing the run with orphan agent E, whose --implementation-plan-shaped pretty-printed-JSON target resolves to no unit at all. G must stay determining and E must produce no eighth unit row: contamination is PER UNIT, never run-wide. wf_rank003 (unrecoverable): D via unknown-disposition-above-determining (a gating candidate with no refuter, ranked above a would-be determining finding) and H via dimension-coverage-gap (a code-mode unit with a correctness refuter but no correctness finder) — siblings, so each is proven not to spill onto the other. Derived by hand: units.total 7; determining 3 (ranks 1, 2, 4); nonDetermining 2 (C, F); unrecoverable 2 (D, H); recoverable 5; recoverableSharePercent 5/7 = 71.4; withinTop n=3 count 2 (A, G) and n=5 count 3 (A, G, B); orphanAgents.finders 1 and runsAffected 1; acTableGapUnits 1 (unit B seeds a FAIL row in its ac table). The nonGatingRefutationSkip and refuterFanout blocks below are this tree own figures, present only so --check/--audit exercise all three sections in one pass; tests/fixtures/token-refuter-severity remains the hand-checked ground truth for those two.",
